      "refersTo": "button-primary-light",
      "description": "Reading-surface action; dark counterpart uses the same CSS with inherited theme variables.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary\">Read the conversation</button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;min-height:44px;padding:12px 18px;border:1px solid var(--accent,#1637bc);border-radius:7px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s;background:var(--accent,#1637bc);color:var(--on-action,#fafbf5);}.ds-primary:hover{background:var(--accent-hover,#102b98);border-color:var(--accent-hover,#102b98)}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#1637bc);outline-offset:4px;}.ds-primary:disabled{opacity:.65;cursor:not-allowed}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-primary{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
